  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Government to deliver education results through payment by results mechanism, which directly contributes to our manifesto commitment on Education. Scale up of EP4R to include continued support and limited construction of schoo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support the Government to deliver education results through payment by results mechanism, which directly contributes to our manifesto commitment on Education. Scale up of EP4R to include continued support and limited construction of schoo is a component of Education Programme For Results (EP4R) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xA3;85,906,327. It works in the following sector(s): Upper Secondary Education (modified and includes data from 11322), Primary education.</narrative>
  </description>
